    "rationale_md": "# Decision \u2014 CASE-002\n\n**Recommendation: Single source: Schrauben Werk Schwaben GmbH (road)** \u2014 landed EUR 38486.26 (EUR 0.2138/pc), full quantity on site 2026-08-31.\n\nConsumption on ASSY-1 ran 18% above forecast for six weeks; on-hand is now below the reorder point with no open PO covering the quarter.\n\n## Why this plan\n\n- The line stops on 2026-09-11 at EUR 9200.00/hour. This plan keeps it running; EUR 0.00 of downtime avoided against the cheapest plan that does not.\n- 180,000 pcs from Schrauben Werk Schwaben GmbH by road, ETA 2026-08-31. Landed EUR 38486.26; line keeps running.\n- Runner-up `STR-02` (Single source: Schrauben Werk Schwaben GmbH (air)): +EUR 14884.40, full qty 2026-08-29, feasible.\n- Runner-up `STR-03` (Single source: Fixando Bolt Praha s.r.o. (road)): EUR -1939.96, full qty 2026-09-05, line stops.\n- Runner-up `STR-04` (Single source: Fixando Bolt Praha s.r.o. (air)): +EUR 12925.68, full qty 2026-09-03, line stops.\n\n## Order lines\n\n| supplier | qty | mode | ETA | landed EUR |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Schrauben Werk Schwaben GmbH | 180,000 | road | 2026-08-31 | 38486.26 |\n\n## What the suppliers actually said\n\n| supplier | stock | offered | lead | confidence |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| SUP-FBP | free_in_stock | 180,000 | 14 d | 73% |\n| SUP-SHW | free_in_stock | 180,000 | 9 d | 78% |\n\n`in_stock_allocated` is why the offered quantity can be far below what was first said to be in stock. Our files are the baseline; a claim never silently overwrites them.\n\n## What a human still owns\n\n- Approving this PR is the approval. Nothing was ordered.\n- Policy: `policy_report.md`. Cost arithmetic: `cost_report.md`. Event log: `events.jsonl`.\n",
